WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.970
What is Code: Realize?

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:05.640
Why was I...

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:10.750
Code: Realize is the beautiful, 
perfect plan our father concocted...

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:16.480
to reduce not only England, but the 
whole world to nothing but ashes!

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.990
Don't worry. Your own will 
has no bearing here!

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.000
Your very existence destroys 
everything around you, after all!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.070
I have a destiny to fulfill,

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.210
as a disciple of Idea.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.740
Idea?

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.320
Cardia, I have come here

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.010
to kill you.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:20.950
Prayer

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:19.230
Since times of old, there 
has existed in this world

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:22.450
an organization that oversees 
history from the shadows.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:24.600
Its name is Idea.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:29.830
It uses any means necessary to 
remove errors from human history

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:33.740
with the goal of guiding mankind 
toward the correct destiny.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:37.140
The correct destiny?

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.350
Humans are weak, and they make mistakes.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.930
That is why we are needed to correct them.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.890
And, Cardia,

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:51.520
Idea believes you are a mistake 
that must be eliminated.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.550
The cursed children of Isaac...

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.960
The keys to the activation 
of Code: Realize.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:03.580
The existence of you and your 
siblings will disturb history

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:05.640
and invite many disasters.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.130
This cannot be ignored.

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:13.890
And that's why you want to kill me.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:15.880
Drink this.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:20.750
It will give you a peaceful death.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.830
Before you fall into Isaac's hands,

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.470
you must be...

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:36.790
<i>You saw it on your way here, didn't you?</i>

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:41.400
<i>The destroyed cityscape, 
bodies lying everywhere...</i>

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.910
<i>They'll all die because of you!</i>

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.650
<i>All of them... Everyone!</i>

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.500
You mustn't!

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.250
I won't use it.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.660
I just need to take it from you, right?

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:06.170
It'll be okay. Thank you 
for worrying about me.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.170
You two.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.670
We're all meeting up.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.110
Okay.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.180
Saint?

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.900
I pray fortune will be on your side.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:25.990
Count?

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.290
Did I miss something?

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.700
No, nothing.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.300
Drac!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.600
Cardia!

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.590
And Sisi, too!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.630
Someone from the army brought them.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:53.220
I brought some things
 I suspect you'll need.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.280
Good boy!

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:57.980
S-Stop that, you boor!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.300
Don't be mad. It was a compliment.

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.970
I told you to stop it!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.730
Where's Lupin?

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.250
He's being treated in that tent over there.

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:17.690
He'll live, but he needs to 
rest for the time being.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.660
He was hurt?

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.470
That's right. And he's 
supposed to be so nimble!

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:26.130
It's not like him to screw up like that.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:29.420
Of course, he's been on 
the move a lot lately.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.570
A little rest will do him some good.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.890
You're very kind, Impey.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:38.270
Well, you know! Half of me
 <i>is</i> made of kindness!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.810
And the other half is made of loudness.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:41.760
That's mean!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:44.730
Why do you say stuff like that, Drac?

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:46.200
It's true, is it not?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.220
Are all the soldiers gathered?

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:50.030
They are.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.500
About ten thousand troops in all.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.030
All are working in coordination.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.380
Many have been wounded,

00:05:56.380 --> 00:06:01.120
but morale is high, and they haven't lost 
their pride as British soldiers.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:06.720
All those who have come together 
to fight for our country

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.680
reassure me more than the most 
powerful weaponry in the world.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:16.010
At dawn, we will march on the enemy's base
 at St. Paul's Cathedral.

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.830
Make the preparations at once.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.060
Your Majesty!

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.840
What's the matter?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.110
So, you're awake?

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:48.020
Hey, Drac. You're here?

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:51.800
Yes. Cardia was here until 
just a moment ago, as well,

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.960
but she left in quite a hurry.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:07.010
Cardia?

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:15.710
What happened with the count?

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.260
Well, I won't force you to tell me.

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:29.510
You've changed a bit since I first met you.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.370
Thank you for becoming my friend.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.950
And for teaching me many things,

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.990
and for worrying about me.

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.680
It's too soon to thank me.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.020
Nothing is over yet...

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.440
for either of us.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.190
The next time I see Finis, 
I won't let him get away.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:53.600
I'm going to finish this.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:57.980
Which means I probably won't be able 
to stick with you until the end.

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:02.540
Once I get my revenge on Finis,

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.790
I'll be killed by Delacroix.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:10.580
I...

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:15.420
I don't want you to die.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.300
Sorry, but...

00:08:24.260 --> 00:08:29.240
There's no chain binding me 
to this life except Finis.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:47.050
It's a little rough, but it'll still make 
some really pretty fireworks!

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:47.840
Huh?!

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:49.770
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:53.590
Come on, Fran, don't scare me.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.020
Oh, sorry.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:56.800
Look at this.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.390
Is that the thing Cardia found?

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.340
Is something written in it?

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:04.870
Yes, a very interesting name.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.700
Remember Nemo?

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:09.470
Nemo? You mean <i>that</i> Nemo?

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:13.610
Yeah. There's a page missing,
 so I can't get all the details...

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:19.380
But it seems Nemo was deeply 
involved in Isaac's plan.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.280
Seriously?

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:25.740
The name "Nautilus" comes up
 along with his name.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.820
I don't know what it means.

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:29.470
Nautilus?

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.590
That sounds familiar...

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.250
Ugh, there's too much we don't know!

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:38.640
If only Saint were here 
at a time like this!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.260
I know.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.440
Saint will come back, won't he?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:45.760
Huh?

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:50.730
Well, you know... Lupin's hurt 
pretty bad, Saint's gone,

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.550
and with London's current state...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:57.150
It makes be feel just a little 
discouraged... Just a little.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:02.280
Er, of course, I'd do anything for Cardia, 
even if it cost my life!

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:04.380
Discouraged, huh?

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.580
I can sort of understand that feeling.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.690
It'll be all right, though.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.780
I'm sure the same goes for everyone.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.070
No one's going to give up.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:15.920
To make her...

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.420
To make Cardia smile again.

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:23.760
What's this? Is a new rival in 
love jumping in the ring now?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:25.610
Maybe.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.570
You are a member of our organization.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.460
She is no more than a mistake of 
history that must be eliminated.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:42.150
Forget her.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:49.200
And if I said I can't?

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:51.660
As a fellow member of Idea,

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.940
I'll just have to open your eyes.

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:03.670
Farewell...

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:38.440
Thanks.

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:41.960
Thanks.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:43.640
Thank you.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:50.520
Have some bread.

00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:53.170
Thanks, miss.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.900
Do your wounds hurt?

00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.580
Nah, thankfully, there 
isn't really any pain.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:02.290
My body just feels a bit heavy.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.380
Oh...

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.330
This is my treasure.

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.350
He's laughing.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.080
I miss them.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:18.010
I want to save this country and 
hurry home to hug my family.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:35.750
If you feel well enough
 to give your rations to a dog,

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.190
then get up and work.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:41.680
Man, don't you know the meaning 
of the word "sympathy"?

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:45.130
No one else comes in here,
 so I have to settle for his attention.

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:47.220
Right, Sisi?

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:50.940
Foolish. Everyone's working 
extra to cover for you.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.970
Stop wasting time and 
get ready for tomorrow.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:58.770
What's Cardia up to?

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:04.200
I've been worried that she's stressing
 over that stuff Finis said...

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.990
That's she's off crying 
by herself somewhere.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:12.440
It's driving me nuts. I wish
 I could do something for her,

00:13:12.740 --> 00:13:14.100
but look at me.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:18.360
Do you love her?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.110
H-Huh?!

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:22.790
That's the relationship 
you two have, isn't it?

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.180
I-I've told you, it's not!

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:28.160
Then what is there to be so worried about?

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.510
There's no guarantee you'll 
both still be alive tomorrow.

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:35.580
Regret is a foolish thing.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.200
If there's something on 
your mind, tell her.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:44.460
Your words might become 
the chain that binds her to this life.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:49.010
That's something I can't do.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:50.290
Van...

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.880
Never thought I'd get that 
kind of advice from you.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:01.010
Is it going to snow or something?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:04.260
My game of friendship with you 
is nearing its end, too.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.900
Take it as a parting gift.

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:13.680
Cardia?

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.850
Are you crying?

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:26.870
I'm scared.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.430
I realized I'm scared.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.690
Of dying.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.980
Never before have I known...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.000
this feeling.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.300
It'll be fine. Don't worry.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.840
You have all of us.

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.740
No matter what happens, we'll protect you.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.630
And we'll save you.

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.340
So...

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.610
There's nothing to be scared of.

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.220
How are you so strong, Lupin?

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:01.700
Aren't you scared?

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.250
Cardia...

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:07.440
Why did you get yourself hurt for my sake?!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:12.770
I was so happy when you 
shielded me, and yet...

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:17.830
I hated that you put yourself 
in danger for me.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.280
I don't know why I feel that way,

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.540
but still...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:27.960
I don't want you facing danger for my sake.

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.540
Because...

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:31.570
If you die, I...

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:34.350
I won't ever see you again!

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:35.300
Cardia.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.910
Why is it, Lupin?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:51.140
When I think about you, my chest hurts.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.560
It hurts so much.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:58.840
Is this what it means to 
have a beating heart?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:00.700
I...

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.260
I'm not going to die.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.840
No matter what happens, I'll live

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:22.370
and protect you until the very end.

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:26.000
Lupin...

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:31.750
So, Princess Cardia's prince 
is a master thief, huh?

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:35.710
Well, he's the genius
 engineer's partner, after all.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.120
Yeah. She looks happy.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.730
We have to stay alive.

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:42.500
Huh?

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:46.180
For her, I could put my life on the line.

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:47.880
But...

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:52.090
I can't die for her sake.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.180
Right!

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:10.190
I'll ask once again.

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.480
From this point on, 
we're risking our lives for real.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.150
Who's with us?

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:20.040
So long as Finis is alive,

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:24.020
it's my duty to pursue him.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:27.150
I'm not going to back out of this now.

00:18:27.590 --> 00:18:29.990
I'm the best engineer in the world,

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:32.140
as well as a soldier of love!

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:37.410
Uh, I mean... What I'm saying is...

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:41.910
For your smile, I can do anything!

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:45.190
Everyone...

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:49.030
May I join you as well, my lady?

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.430
Count!

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:05.620
Y-You're way late, Saint!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.440
What were you doing?!

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.170
Saint...

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:13.730
I'm going, too.

00:19:14.470 --> 00:19:15.670
Drac!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.800
Battles between humans mean nothing to me.

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:25.220
And Helsing, this most certainly 
does not mean I've forgiven you!

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.070
But I do like Cardia.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:33.140
Besides, it's already been decided 
that I'm going to kill you!

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:35.870
I can't have you going off 
and dying on your own!

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.290
So... I will fight with you!

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.690
You've gotten very brave.

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.360
D-Don't you laugh!

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.820
I appreciate it.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.890
Uh... Uh-huh...

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:55.210
Princess, is there anything 
you'd like to say?

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:59.260
Thank you.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:03.640
I've made it this far because 
all of you were with me.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.790
Now, please...

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:10.090
Help me for just a bit longer.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:21.970
We, the British Army, will now march on 
the Twilight base, St. Paul's Cathedral.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.740
A diversion force will move with 
the intent of a frontal assault,

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:29.150
while another force will infiltrate 
the inside from a separate route.

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:33.170
We will thus attack from both inside 
and outside simultaneously.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.600
I know you all have your reasons to fight.

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:42.760
For your country, for your 
family, for yourself...

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:47.910
However, I beg of all the strong 
warriors who have gathered here...

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:51.260
Right now, for this moment alone,

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:54.700
please act as the sword 
of Alexandrina Victoria!

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:58.190
So that we may reclaim our pride!

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.340
<i>It's starting.</i>

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:13.950
<i>I don't know what awaits us 
at the end of this battle...</i>

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.710
<i>But they're all here. Lupin is here.</i>

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.070
<i>I can feel that I want to live 
because I'm not alone.</i>

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:25.000
<i>I...</i>

00:21:25.850 --> 00:21:27.200
<i>won't run anymore!</i>

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:04.190
Charge!

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:07.860
It's begun.

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:12.260
We'll have to pray that Finis
 doesn't outsmart us again this time.

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:14.210
Let's hope for the best.

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:17.700
Is our adviser not a friend of yours?

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:22.020
There'll be time to chat later.

00:23:22.020 --> 00:23:24.720
We need to dive in before 
the chaos dies down.

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:26.450
R-Right!

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:39.020
I'm waiting for you, Sister...
